        Our commitment to precision engineering, continuous material innovation, and strict quality control sets the benchmark in industrial graphite manufacturing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Strengths Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      {strengths.map((item) => (
        <div class="bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-industrial-copper/50 p-8 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-industrial group">
